ent-RedspaceGate = Euclidean gate
    .desc = A device built to open corridors through the space between worlds. Can be used as a local teleportation bridge.
ent-RedspaceGateFlatpack = Euclidean gate flatpack
    .desc = A dense, folded Euclidean gate. Use a multitool on it to unfold it in place.
ent-RedspacePortal = Euclidean portal
    .desc = A crimson tear held open by a Euclidean gate. It leads back to the gate.
ent-RedspaceGateUnfolding = unfolding Euclidean gate
    .desc = A Euclidean gate assembling itself. Better stand back.
